Public access from build agents (build-proxy-acl)

Repository that contains and is used to maintain ACLs for Build proxy cache.

❕ ❕ ❕

Signed commit are required prior merging. Please sign your commit before opening a pull request. Learn more about signed commits on CDS (Continuous Delivery Security) team's homepage. Please, refer to the How do I add new ACL rule for my TeamCity project(s)/build configuration? section before opening your PR.

